+- Test totals: harness 403 passed (403 tests, 0 fail); matching 156; shared 172; recurrence 77; service 757; web 729; e2e helper tests 15. No `not ok` line.
+- Docs-claims (phase copy) over README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, `docs/*.md`, `.claude/CLAUDE.md`: `checked=1349 misses=0`
+- Other gates: `pnpm typecheck` clean (also run by the pre-commit hook on both commits); `pnpm lint`, `pnpm format:check`, `pnpm knip` clean; `knip-baseline: 28 rows match`; `pnpm jscpd` 1.14% (limit 2%); `repo-hygiene: clean (1025 files, 14 scripts)`; `doc-links: files=11 links=35 broken=0`
