+The Task 1 and Task 2 verify commands were run in segments (same commands, same order) rather than as one chained shell line, so that the long builds and the test suite could report their own exit codes. The first Task 2 commit attempt was rejected by commitlint (a body line over 100 characters); the body was shortened and the commit retried with identical content.
